<p>Rundown of the methods in the <code>PostForm</code> component:</p>
<ul>
<li>The <code>mount</code> method is used to set the initial values for the form fields when editing a post. The post data is passed to the component as a parameter.</li>
<li>The <code>save</code> method is called when the form is submitted. It validates the form fields, creates a new post or updates an existing one, and redirects to the post detail page.</li>
<li>The <code>render</code> method fetches all tags from the database and passes them to the view.</li>
<li>In the <code>rules</code> property, we define the validation rules for the form fields.</li>
</ul>
