<p>In the <code>PostPolicy</code> class, we define the <code>update</code> and <code>delete</code> methods to check if the current user is the author of the post. If the user is the author, the method returns <code>true</code>, allowing the user to update or delete the post. Otherwise, it returns <code>false</code> to deny access and prevent unauthorized actions.</p>
